        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top: 0&quot;&gt;
      dom:locatedAt is only defined on dom:Child, but not on other classes,
      such as dom:Treatment or dom:Activity, as the child and a treatment or
      activity in which it is involved in are &amp;quot;connected&amp;quot; through the time
      stamp of the corresponding quadruple
    &lt;/p&gt;</rdfs:comment>
    </rdf:Description>
